  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/05/SoniaOlmedoHomenatgeLosRodriguez.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(64 fotos) New Robinson Sal&oacute;n Lounge, en la calle San Bernardo, 17 de Onda, ha acogido la tarde de este domingo el concierto de Sonia Olmedo con Feat en homenaje a Los Rodr&iacute;guez. El &eacute;xito ha sido total y el local estaba lleno.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festarobinsonlosrodriguez/img_6476.jpg\" alt=\"img_6476\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festarobinsonlosrodriguez/img_6477.jpg\" alt=\"img_6477\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festarobinsonlosrodriguez/img_6478.jpg\" alt=\"img_6478\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festarobinsonlosrodriguez/img_6479.jpg\" alt=\"img_6479\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festarobinsonlosrodriguez/img_6480.jpg\" alt=\"img_6480\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festarobinsonlosrodriguez/img_6482.jpg\" alt=\"img_6482\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festarobinsonlosrodriguez/img_6483.jpg\" alt=\"img_6483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festarobinsonlosrodriguez/img_6485.jpg\" alt=\"img_6485\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festarobinsonlosrodriguez/img_648